# HAM Radio Controller - ESP32 DRA818V Transceiver

A sophisticated web-based controller for DRA818V ham radio transceiver modules using ESP32. Features a beautiful responsive web interface with real-time controls, channel management, and WiFi configuration.

![HAM Radio Controller](https://img.shields.io/badge/Project-HAM%20Radio-blue)
![ESP32](https://img.shields.io/badge/ESP32-Compatible-green)
![DRA818V](https://img.shields.io/badge/DRA818V-Transceiver-orange)

## ✨ Features

### 🎛️ Core Functionality
- **Frequency Control**: 134-174 MHz range with adjustable steps
- **Real-time Audio Controls**: Instant volume and squelch adjustment
- **CTCSS Support**: Programmable TX/RX tone squelch
- **Channel Spacing**: 12.5KHz (Narrow) / 25KHz (Wide)
- **Power Management**: 1W / 0.5W output power selection

### 🌐 Web Interface
- **Responsive Design**: Works perfectly on desktop and mobile
- **Real-time Updates**: Live frequency display and status
- **Channel Management**: Save, load, and delete frequency presets
- **Beautiful UI**: Modern gradient design with smooth animations
- **Touch-friendly**: Large buttons optimized for mobile use

### 📡 Connectivity
- **Dual WiFi Mode**: Access Point + Station mode
- **Auto-reconnect**: Automatic WiFi reconnection
- **Captive Portal**: Easy initial setup
- **mDNS Support**: Access via `http://esp32.local`

### 🖥️ OLED Display
- **Live Status**: Frequency, TX/RX status, power level
- **Network Info**: WiFi/AP mode and IP address
- **Module Status**: DRA818V connectivity status
- **Compact Layout**: Maximum information in minimal space

## 🛠️ Hardware Requirements

### Components
- ESP32 Development Board
- DRA818V VHF/UHF Transceiver Module
- SSD1306 OLED Display (128x64)
- Antenna (VHF 2m band recommended)
- Power Supply (5V/2A recommended)
- Breadboard/Jumper Wires

### Pin Connections
| ESP32 Pin | DRA818V Pin | OLED Pin | Function |
|-----------|-------------|----------|----------|
| GPIO16    | RX          | -        | DRA818V RX |
| GPIO17    | TX          | -        | DRA818V TX |
| GPIO18    | PTT         | -        | Push-to-Talk |
| GPIO23    | POWER       | -        | Module Power |
| GPIO13    | PWR_SEL     | -        | Power Level (1W/0.5W) |
| GPIO21    | -           | SDA      | OLED Data |
| GPIO22    | -           | SCL      | OLED Clock |
| -         | -           | VCC      | 3.3V      |
| -         | -           | GND      | Ground    |

